{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1371,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a31c4203111702cfbd1e709",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！有股神奇的力量在涌现……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6b87b51ae35a5417d9d774254ffc9843a259d927e2905e18f921dded260ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216788ca00b8c18f24c9faf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开运大吉！神灵力量大爆发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e592f6e58cfaad1845868a3e893699aab8afc0b119d4908d0f8caf54b084cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de31fb1d636f2d37ef9d13a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我叫待兼福来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca42f0bb59ba723f8cfde3d2654053d62fabac23b881b37ac015be6168acdf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7762960b01d0721ac5d8c74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用新的占卜来成为助力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721014fd941d12054acc7e9df2bfbb5fdb74dfbf6157ad3537c8d974f5898cd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9395df3c544adcb6aaf8250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就当作是搭到了宝船，\r\n全都交给我吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a7ed1310a563f006d88d637b2307501458ff085f020aaa1079da3b41af5ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38e1ef3b7fe12587411fefa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的能量正在我的体内诞生～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad128467fb688c624b5eed16a509584bec3437d671989bb4083f0b840d5c3972",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6407e14e6db8376261cb7b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！？看、看见了！\r\n是幸运气势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ec7cce76b6aa891add89f6dca0e37bc4a835fdb1a5141a09ba21c8734c115a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6071ca16af19bbbb9c90659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会带着你……\r\n一起获得最棒的幸运体验！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc739ab12c05cb8e7a0f6493a1f7471cc23d879199ebb18d131505b085144b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e6f230294170d18696211a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是待兼福来，\r\n我会带着满满的幸运前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edcbf2c0f098430f4f0e077bd0f43b0d002704ec4b88bba6ec96de3c516fd767",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9481de3c711c027f43a7ddad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随心所欲地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec011f6695a00dd2c1a5582f44f935ea5711c986d3f322b5142de7783661d75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b23acbf1fb1b1e3a2d18b0b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当你的梦想与我奔驰的身影\r\n交迭在一起时，\r\n心情一定会很舒畅吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad1ecb204f4870f9de16454ae9af60ea1dda46e057494aa148e81c83e2e6045",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019bca7bc05fe1531608db63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8866752d5a0a75099abb60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3488e94bb5d64f9e5fec7da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你理解自由的价值。\r\n倘若你我都能够做自己，那么待在\r\n彼此身边也是件很快乐的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd660a83b3189d12e17934467431c95bdc4ae05c9aaab9f74d3c87a47154c5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7871e4466c3bd0f8fada1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知不觉间，\r\n在相同的地方留下了足迹……\r\n我很喜欢这样的经验呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbd51984ad158f02854dc1d9f5023781e34a24109a2ba12569659d969f471d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e7708ed3e0315e79522193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一年要开始了呢。\r\n那么就先将一切抛诸脑后，\r\n迈开脚步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "101a4f375870d06471c6452d96d9b862617698e17ec004361a54d7c98230c91a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12944cbf0e12a7b6332f47fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉今天的晚餐会是一堆巧克力。\r\n呵呵，很奢侈对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2efd68d9d031824efb25c264ffff1ccd50bb5b6ae235e20ceae85acb34481730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8245979ffc317345322b2d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真高兴可以见到你。\r\n我一直很想在与你四目交接的\r\n距离下，听听你的笑声呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45a64b7e5c04bd530b01ee71d4161e745749413c866aed55e08642328014ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be6bedb38c2d5e11cb07809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星们聚集起来，\r\n化作连系两人的桥梁……\r\n它们真是善良呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5339c4d64f539578291de0b2bcb14cebc3abe6d43f245aa8c3b6c207179f77bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c410c6cf1c9c8db9adb2c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刻意选择恶作剧也很不错对吧。\r\n毕竟这样会让我很期待\r\n对方打算对我做什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db80695765cb1c2a16055086d8dc7f95a4191d0e2f9794185fc6554fb1d0b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c743438309b3203ce9bcb0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声音与光线熠熠生辉，\r\n空气也在喧嚣着。\r\n能充分感受到欢闹的气氛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "476d57df6294dca9c80981af1352356b5dacd69d79e46582f7d41557ccc7833d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12624e8e96907520a710b7c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待会你打算怎么度过呢？\r\n我应该会在听了你的行程后，\r\n再决定要去哪里吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d7f8b1ac702f39d1f3d044bc05c3522e7c5a8c1d47a2014855515846746b4c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aad0133c070af81ef0ab01f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5d00a034cd0fa92bc961e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也要划下句号了呢……\r\n趁着现在回忆过去种种，\r\n也挺不错的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71187c9b6ee65ddcfa52d546e85dbc451a6b41b24a3b86e951caed8844f659e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6716c9e6ba1ab066638b685e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n我很想听你亲口告诉我，\r\n你这一年有什么改变呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713fe61e7d93f7f11e2c1533e02656d0d245c7d579c47748ac6a1a4d7f7486f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6290b966bdb79ae322ea0ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看得出来你的瞳孔里写满雀跃。\r\n呵呵，希望从今以后的时间，\r\n也能够成为你的宝物呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb8a54fd775dc821eab05f25118d13a98f231b6f3e432021e41bd92fe9d0e9eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3222424917419a90076d5525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，对哦。\r\n原来今天是我的生日啊。不要紧，\r\n你可以保持平常心和我相处就好啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c50cbebedc71793241199194de253c133daf30ddd53506d7ab739f24dc0909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600a3b6f8595fc27114cd319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要的东西？嗯……\r\n可以等我想到的时候再跟你说吗？\r\n因为我想好好珍惜收到的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64c682ad6486c89fbd038682123594949450a98bbf1ef43c6567e3e872f2c5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21f0b356794e3d54a78692d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到新公告了。\r\n有空的时候再去看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb11d19aa4c9e6284afd0b4f834f9009b615d5c001785a358646003c6f76c72a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b4caa45378e5c21514b825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物啰。\r\n希望是会让人开心的东西呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4080008fb06c99da9d4221703829ca4f34bf1ed4abf1bf6e319a44060728f45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3feec971d79d32c9443a7ac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是你完成任务了。\r\n你这么认真，真是了不起呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05ad0498259f0fc63061c6a90d09e03b449914ea422f9e0b2348f4abde246a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18a18b5ded1bdf8fea12b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像很快就要办活动了。\r\n不知道届时会发生什么事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a5691adac6c945cdff5834f83235ec349b3a83a270e39a36fcdef13e6af03db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b8f571dce5203333e3a0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎开始了。\r\n待会过去露个脸吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "216670c09193b78441ce5dad970eaffade2800e2a20c9a162d5a20f472c444e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f55ffccdff52d0ea3789191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……再接再厉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e393779649c103908e67644db51f25f1522edd78bcdb438f48c42cce7791cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2640310b289029ca885abaa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说名册等级提升了。\r\n不知道变成什么样子了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b92425ec6804c2053aeff73f50c6345dc25b3ac83431104992cdab2ce24c3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c4a302d7587aab4ee2a079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジャケット、好きなんだ。\r\nすぐ着られるし、すぐ脱げるから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9721a454ef7192ba8f769a5c4570eb7ee607fabe471ab51a2e4bbd5da331e98f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:342430653ceee762b72f0366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ルドルフと外を歩いてると、\r\nみんなアタシにばかり話しかけて\r\nくるんだ。なんでかな？変なの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb72ae7e8ffab743b40abf29094ef17407349901b8f934958a464ba99ee745d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26adee743c83cc0ba1419d34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "デニムっていいよね。\r\n使えば使うほど、\r\nアタシの姿に馴染んでくれる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65add6b05e5faa5b3064a2a732dcb4f91964b662dc63ab26950ce1bed5c88c0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4ee9cb26cde2826c056b6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也没办法呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4293c1e03e0e41dc40818f8627ae982ea658d1823cac1ac3739afc89c9fc70be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18b51a8b868a0b826cb85d0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b1d8b3eb3a6c5870f0875981ac56e8484b0a39557ab9ab1f5743d001eb51ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2873871fbc507d24159888de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……再接再厉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e393779649c103908e67644db51f25f1522edd78bcdb438f48c42cce7791cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307cd81cb785da33cd68694f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也没办法呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4293c1e03e0e41dc40818f8627ae982ea658d1823cac1ac3739afc89c9fc70be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade64c2605c21ca9e393c962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新高分纪录！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76369e2075097f0dbc9a442a5185e1df9061a17e8e3b9ab5146773281a81009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c49a6f8314d21bf25eb7745",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dee5939d2b38661086e5815f84384f0a3bea2688058a4deb13c2dc11bbe0ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6815477743440fa89cedda29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
